7. The following points that arise for my consideration;
1. Whether the prosecution proves beyond all reasonable doubts that on 16.10.2019 at 12.30 pm when Cw1 was sitting opposite to Bata showroom after consuming alcohol at Tirumala Bar, the accused No.1 and 2 by make believing Cw1 stating that they will drop near the house and when Cw1 Nagaraju C vs Yashwantha on 15 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/76586819/
2 is in intoxicating condition collected the gold ornaments and phone from the Cw1 and have committed offences punishable under Section 420 r/w Sec.34 of IPC?
